---
title: "Internal sendWebhook task completion follows promise resolution"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Due task
  s1: HTTP request running
  s2: Rejected promise, retry write pending
  s3: Resolved promise, success write pending
  s4: Task succeeded, HTTP 500 response
  s5: Task succeeded, receiver accepted
  s6: Attempt limit reached
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: processor selects due task
  s1 --> s2: transport or handler rejects
  s1 --> s3: receiver returns HTTP 500 or receiver returns success
  s2 --> s0: increment attempt and reschedule if configured
  s3 --> s4: increment attempt and save succeededAt
  s3 --> s5: increment attempt and save succeededAt
  s2 --> s6: increment attempt and reschedule if configured
